{
  "slug": "mutagent",
  "name": "Mutagent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official MutagenT skills bundle for AI coding agents — guides Claude Code through prompt upload, dataset curation, evaluation rubric creation, optimization, framework tracing, and (planned) multi-turn agent design.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `mutagent-cli` (MutagenT CLI - the command-line client for the MutagenT platform).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mutagent@claude-community` from `mutagent-io/skills`.\n\nThe public marketplace of MutagenT skills for AI coding agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Aider, Continue — anything that consumes the Agent Skills spec). The current skill teaches an agent how to set up the MutagenT CLI, install lifecycle packages, inspect workspace and usage information, and send product feedback.",
